  "details": "The feature to edit terrain with triggers for a world be really nice, I currently have 3 terrains each 50MB on my computer and around 10MB each on the world data. This is really annoying because I want a low high and ultra terrain depending on your computer/quest. The main difference is trees and pixel error, that's all I change, but that small change is 30MB added to my world when quest is already maxed at 50MB. This would allow people to use multiple combinations for the optimal performance for your system without having a huge world size. If i am missing something that already lets you do this, please let me know, I want to add more to my world than trees and keep quest compatibility.",
